  "description": "The Xion Electric Three-Seater Pedicab is a commercial-grade urban transport vehicle built for operators running ride services, event fleets, and city tours.\n\nQuick specs: 3 passengers · 40+ mile range · 72V 58Ah battery · 750W direct-drive transaxle · 2,000 lb payload · commercial duty cycle (300+ days/yr) · American-made frame, assembled in San Diego\n\nSpecs\n\nBuilt for Revenue\n\nXion pedicabs are used by active operators across U.S. cities, with $30,000–$35,000 revenue potential per vehicle per year from rides, advertising wraps, and private event bookings. The three-seater is the go-to starter fleet vehicle — low operating cost, easy to maneuver, and proven in high-foot-traffic markets.\n\nWhat's Included\n\nEvery unit ships fully assembled and configured with Chariot app integration for fleet tracking, fare management, and maintenance alerts. Optional add-ons: sound system, custom branding wrap, LED lighting package.\n\nFleet pricing available for 3+ units. 2-year frame warranty, 1-year motor & battery warranty. Financing options available.",
